		<item>
		<title>
		By: nursesrevision@gmail.com		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/resuscitation/#comment-247</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[nursesrevision@gmail.com]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 15 May 2023 04:24:16 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=5127#comment-247</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[In reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/resuscitation/#comment-244&quot;&gt;Muyobokye Paul&lt;/a&gt;.

Give 1 to 2 mls per kilogram body weight of 25% dextrose solution intravenously.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In reply to <a href="https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/resuscitation/#comment-244">Muyobokye Paul</a>.</p>
<p>Give 1 to 2 mls per kilogram body weight of 25% dextrose solution intravenously.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
